<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<ResourceDictionary
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/dotnet/2021/maui"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2009/xaml">

    <!--
        The only TargetType-only styles the application keeps.

        There is deliberately NO implicit Border, Button, Entry, Editor or Picker style.
        The stock template had one for Border. Dropping it is safe: the Task 3 audit walked
        all 33 real Border elements (the often-quoted 61 counted 28 property elements such
        as the Shadow and StrokeShape sub-elements as if they were Borders) and found that
        none of them paints the stock grey stroke. 21 set Stroke themselves, 5 receive it
        from a keyed style or from visual states, and 7 set StrokeThickness to zero. See the
        audit table for the per-site record.

        The reason for omitting the implicit style is not that it was doing damage — it was
        not. It is that every Border should state its own intent at the point of use, rather
        than inherit an outline nobody chose.

        ONE inherited property is real: AreaSidebarItem.xaml:10 sets no StrokeShape and
        currently takes Rectangle from the stock style. It must be re-declared explicitly
        during migration.

        The Label default exists only so no text falls back to a platform font once the
        OpenSans registrations are removed.

        The Shell style keeps the four TabBar setters carried by the stock style it replaces.
        AppShell currently declares a single ShellContent and shows no tab bar, so they paint
        nothing today; they are retained so that this dictionary is a strict superset of what
        it supersedes and adding a second Shell item cannot regress the chrome.
    -->

    <Style TargetType="Label">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource DmFontBody}" />
    </Style>

    <!--
        Geometry-only implicit Button style.

        This exists solely so that deleting the stock Button style in
        Resources/Styles/Styles.xaml (Task 10) is a geometry no-op. The Task 4b
        measurement walked every Button in the app and found 18 of the 21 rely on
        that stock style for at least one of Padding, MinimumHeightRequest or
        CornerRadius; MAUI leaves MinimumHeightRequest unset by default, so
        removing the stock style without this one would shrink buttons below the
        44px minimum touch target across the whole app.

        Colour and font are deliberately excluded here. They remain the exclusive
        property of the keyed DmButton* styles in Controls.Base.xaml and its
        derivatives; duplicating either here would give the app two sources of
        truth for the same property.

        None of the five values below matches an existing token in Tokens.xaml
        (the radius tokens are 2/3/4, the stroke tokens are 1/2), so all five are
        literals. CornerRadius="8" in particular mirrors the stock Styles.xaml
        value it replaces and is not a candidate for a new radius token.
    -->
    <Style TargetType="Button">
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="14,10" />
        <Setter Property="MinimumHeightRequest" Value="44" />
        <Setter Property="MinimumWidthRequest" Value="44" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="8" />
        <Setter Property="BorderWidth" Value="0" />
    </Style>

    <Style TargetType="Page" ApplyToDerivedTypes="True">
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
        <Setter Property="BackgroundColor" Value="{StaticResource DmSurfaceTavern}" />
    </Style>

    <Style TargetType="Shell" ApplyToDerivedTypes="True">
        <Setter Property="Shell.BackgroundColor" Value="{StaticResource DmSurfaceTavern}" />
        <Setter Property="Shell.ForegroundColor" Value="{StaticResource DmAccentGold}" />
        <Setter Property="Shell.TitleColor" Value="{StaticResource DmTextTavern}" />
        <Setter Property="Shell.DisabledColor" Value="{StaticResource DmTextTavernMuted}" />
        <Setter Property="Shell.UnselectedColor" Value="{StaticResource DmTextTavernMuted}" />
        <Setter Property="Shell.NavBarHasShadow" Value="False" />
        <Setter Property="Shell.TabBarBackgroundColor" Value="{StaticResource DmSurfaceTavern}" />
        <Setter Property="Shell.TabBarForegroundColor" Value="{StaticResource DmAccentGold}" />
        <Setter Property="Shell.TabBarTitleColor" Value="{StaticResource DmAccentGold}" />
        <Setter Property="Shell.TabBarUnselectedColor" Value="{StaticResource DmTextTavernMuted}" />
    </Style>

</ResourceDictionary>
